WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.020
This module will focus on

2
00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.735
some basic strategies
to use in bull markets

3
00:00:24.735 --> 00:00:29.555
when prices rise and in bear
markets when prices fall.

4
00:00:29.555 --> 00:00:31.820
As you may have gathered
from earlier lessons,

5
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.250
the characteristics
of options requires

6
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.330
skill and precision when
making investment decisions.

7
00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:39.860
In this module we'll
offer an explanation of

8
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.500
several strategies for either
type of market outlook.

9
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.030
We'll also walk you through

10
00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:45.820
what they're designed to achieve.

11
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:47.180
We'll further provide

12
00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.400
a practical demonstration
of how to set

13
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.345
up each trade using IBKR's
Trader Workstation.

14
00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:54.860
By the end of this module,

15
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.170
you should have a clear
understanding how to use

16
00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.320
options to plan for both
up and down markets.

17
00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:09.190
Let's get started.